-- The entrance chamber (the book's Area 1 map, 2A-2B), redrawn in our pieces. The book's page has
-- west at the top; this is turned so north is up, as the compass says: the front doors on the west
-- wall, the doors on to the Hall of Paintings (north) and the Chamber of Ancients (south) in the
-- east wall, the metal man standing between them and the donation case in the middle. Stretched
-- to fill the mat; the narrow porch's cut corners stay. The south wall is left off: the DM's side.

